  "acceptance": {
    "disjointCapacity": "PASS_REFERENCE_MODEL: active+reconnect_grace+reserved=occupancy<=effective hard; offers only below target<=hard",
    "oneAccountAndTravel": "PASS_REFERENCE_MODEL: duplicate tabs/claim preserve one record/slot, grace retains lease and bounds deadline, room-full travel keeps global slot; room holds separate",
    "drainingAndPendingHard": "PASS_REFERENCE_MODEL: target reduction never kicks; DRAINING_LIMIT retained even while paused; hard reduction pending until occupancy fits",
    "finiteVersionedOwnContracts": "PASS: strict policy/ticket/offer/lease/capacity/command schemas; no actor/clock/role/SQL/cap authority in public commands, no peer/account list or fabricated exact ETA",
    "execution": "PASS: implemented admission-contract lane,16cases including1200deterministic mixed transitions;84governance/354unit, finaltypes/lint/build/architecture/CI and merged source parity"
  },
  "limitations": [
    "N09-01 is additive contracts and a deterministic in-memory reference model only. No runtime admission route, global grant allocator, migration, room hook, client queue or activation is introduced.",
    "No PostgreSQL atomicity/race/restart/lease-janitor or actual room-admission acceptance is claimed. Authenticated actor binding, durable receipts, request-version validation, SQL locking/fencing and owner reconciliation belong to N09-02.",
    "The model clock and new identifiers are trusted allocator inputs, never client timestamps or actor claims. ACTIVE is conservatively retained until authoritative release; TTL alone cannot silently forget an active room player.",
    "Queue pause stops new offers; existing counted reservations/grace can transition without another slot. Runtime maintenance/safety/entitlement and session revocation remain independent stronger gates.",
    "Policy/queue/TTL numeric ceilings and synthetic caps are validation/model parameters, not sustainable CCU, recommended production capacity or authorization to raise a real cap. N08/N09-04 evidence gates remain.",
    "Previous354-unit/focused runs overlap;1200transition steps are inside one case, not1200separate tests. No new browser/image/native/performance/deployment qualification is claimed.",
    "Source matches final committed6a51979; preceding8998d403 qualification is retained, including the new edge failure before the draining-priority fix.",
    "Original43SQL, all40prior evidence records, historical151Mxx ledger, one owner/separate worker/defaults and every unrelated task/platform context preserved.",
    "N04-02 and N07-04 remain externally blocked for hosted/App and actual staging scrape. Owner has no Mac/Xcode/iPhone; N14 conditional/fiveTODO, distribution false, release NOT_REQUESTED. Raw artifacts private local, not off-host archived."
  ],
